OL,3,AParents' concerns to trigger urgent
OL,4,Achecks in A&E
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new National Paediatric Early
OL,7,FWarning System (PEWS) asks staff to
OL,8,Fcheck, log and grade vital signs, such
OL,9,Fas blood pressure, heart rate and
OL,10,Foxygen levels.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
