OL,3,ATrump makes final campaign push in
OL,4,Afinal weekend before election
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the last weekend before the pivotal
OL,7,Fmidterm elections, US President Donald
OL,8,FTrump has made a final pitch to voters
OL,9,Fin hopes of keeping Republicans in
OL,10,Fcontrol of Congress.
OL,12,FTrump held rallies in Florida, Iowa and
OL,13,FKansas - states he won in past
OL,14,Felections - in a sign of Republicans'
OL,15,Fdefensive stance ahead of Tuesday's
OL,16,Fvote.
OL,18,FFacing voter frustration over rising
OL,19,Fprices, Trump sought to tamp down such
OL,20,Fconcerns and shift focus on attacking
OL,21,FDemocrats, saying they would "bankrupt"
OL,22,Ffamilies if elected.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
